   "c:210"},ExpressionUUID->"822bba9d-877d-40a7-b3b9-a0d43e4fd072"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The optional parameter ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox[
    RowBox[{"Split", "\[Rule]", "f"}], "Program"], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"eb3fe3dd-b8c1-4c2a-b9f0-c975ed923fb5"],
 " instructs the space constructor to split the space into homogeneous \
components. The value of ",
 StyleBox["f ", "Var"],
 " is a constant on each component. Splitting increases the speed of \
calculations."
}], "Text",
 TextAlignment->Left,
 TextJustification->1,
 CellTags->{
  "Split", "b:3.18"},ExpressionUUID->"73c11bee-ed89-4652-934f-99b22dd11b69"]
